<http://data.silknow.org/object/c3112608-af8b-3cea-95f8-c203b0dd4855/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Punto tagliato or tela tagliata. cut-work.  Towel.  Across each end is a band of cut-work, with curved openings filled with reticella.  The linen that is left is embroidered with punto reale (laid-work) and punto riccio.  Sewed on to the ends is a strip of bobbin lace made in imitation of reticella, and finished with a fringe."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/c3112608-af8b-3cea-95f8-c203b0dd4855> .

